  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = 2 - 2^(1)/(3) + 2^(2)/(3)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a - b)³ = a³ - b³ - 3ab (a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x = 2 - 2^(1)/(3) + 2^(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ x - 2 = 2^(2)/(3) - 2^(1)/(3) -------- (1)\n\nCubing both sides\n\n⇒ (x - 2)³ = (2^(2)/(3) - 2^(1)/(3))³ \n\n⇒ x³ - 8 - 3 × 2 × x (x - 2) = 2² - 2 - 3 × 2^(2)/(3) × 2^(1)/(3) (2^(2)/(3) - 2^(1)/(3))\n\n​​⇒ x3 - 8 - 6x² + 12x = 2 - 6 ×( x - 2) [from eq. (1)]\n\n​​⇒ x3 - 8 - 6x2 + 12x = 2 - 6x + 12\n\n​​⇒ x3 - 6x2 + 18x = 14 + 8 = 22\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 22.**\n\n69:Tf54,\n&",
